WEBVTT

00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:07.820
Who's there?

00:00:10.997 --> 00:00:12.781
Hello?

00:00:12.781 --> 00:00:14.914
Hello?

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.221
What's that for?

00:00:17.221 --> 00:00:20.746
Oh, nothing.
I was expecting...

00:00:20.746 --> 00:00:22.139
It doesn't matter.

00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:24.402
Come on in.
I just made a pot of tea.

00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:29.537
Hagrid, are you okay?

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:32.627
I'm fine. I'm all right.

00:00:32.627 --> 00:00:35.282
Did you hear
about Hermione?

00:00:35.282 --> 00:00:37.545
Oh, yeah, I heard about that,
all right.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:44.465
Look, we have to
ask you something.

00:00:44.465 --> 00:00:47.512
Do you know who's opened
the Chamber of Secrets?

00:00:50.428 --> 00:00:52.299
What you have to understand
about that is--

00:00:52.299 --> 00:00:54.693
[KNOCKING AND FANG BARKING]

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:56.477
Quick, under the cloak.

00:00:56.477 --> 00:00:59.393
Don't say a word.
Be quiet. Both of you.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.315
Oh. Professor Dumbledore, sir.

00:01:08.315 --> 00:01:12.276
Good evening, Hagrid.
I wonder, could we...?

00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:14.887
Of course. Come in. Come in.

00:01:14.887 --> 00:01:16.758
That's Dad's boss,

00:01:16.758 --> 00:01:20.588
Cornelius Fudge,
the Minister of Magic.

00:01:20.588 --> 00:01:23.417
Bad business, Hagrid,
very bad business.

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:25.245
Had to come.

00:01:25.245 --> 00:01:26.942
Three attacks
on Muggle-borns.

00:01:26.942 --> 00:01:28.640
Things have gone
far enough.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.598
The Ministry's
got to act.

00:01:30.598 --> 00:01:31.599
But I never--

00:01:31.599 --> 00:01:34.080
You know I never, professor.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.301
I want it understood, Cornelius,

00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:39.868
that Hagrid...
has my full confidence.

00:01:41.696 --> 00:01:45.613
Albus, look,
Hagrid's record is against him.

00:01:45.613 --> 00:01:46.745
I've got to take him.

00:01:46.745 --> 00:01:48.007
Take me?

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.444
Take me where?
Not Azkaban prison!

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:53.012
I'm afraid we have
no choice, Hagrid.

00:01:55.101 --> 00:01:58.539
Already here, Fudge? Good.

00:01:58.539 --> 00:02:00.541
What are you
doing here?

00:02:00.541 --> 00:02:02.195
Get out of my house!

00:02:02.195 --> 00:02:04.458
Believe me,

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:07.157
I take absolutely no pleasure
being inside your...

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.294
You call this a house? Hm.

00:02:14.294 --> 00:02:16.731
No, I simply
called at the school

00:02:16.731 --> 00:02:19.604
and was told
the headmaster was here.

00:02:19.604 --> 00:02:23.434
Well, what exactly is it
that you want with me?

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.000
The other governors and I

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.177
have decided it's time
for you to step aside.

00:02:30.136 --> 00:02:32.312
This is an order of suspension.

00:02:37.578 --> 00:02:41.147
You'll find
all 12 signatures on it.

00:02:46.239 --> 00:02:50.287
I'm afraid we feel
you've rather lost your touch.

00:02:50.287 --> 00:02:52.550
Well, what, with
all these attacks,

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:56.945
there'll be no Muggle-borns
left at Hogwarts.

00:02:56.945 --> 00:02:58.556
I can only imagine

00:02:58.556 --> 00:03:01.036
what an awful loss
that would be to the school.

00:03:01.036 --> 00:03:03.343
You can't take
Professor Dumbledore away.

00:03:03.343 --> 00:03:04.823
Take him away,

00:03:04.823 --> 00:03:06.651
and the Muggle-borns
won't stand a chance.

00:03:06.651 --> 00:03:08.870
You mark my words,
there'll be killings next.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.132
You think so?

00:03:10.132 --> 00:03:12.439
Calm yourself, Hagrid.

00:03:15.007 --> 00:03:17.836
If the governors
desire my removal,

00:03:17.836 --> 00:03:21.622
I will, of course, step aside.

00:03:23.058 --> 00:03:25.147
However...

00:03:25.147 --> 00:03:27.541
you will find that help

00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:30.805
will always
be given at Hogwarts

00:03:30.805 --> 00:03:34.853
to those who ask for it.

00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:43.296
Admirable sentiments.

00:03:43.296 --> 00:03:45.255
Shall we?

00:03:58.311 --> 00:04:00.270
Fudge.

00:04:01.619 --> 00:04:04.186
Come, Hagrid.

00:04:04.186 --> 00:04:05.405
Well?

00:04:05.405 --> 00:04:06.406
[HAGRID COUGHS]

00:04:06.406 --> 00:04:07.668
If...

00:04:07.668 --> 00:04:11.063
If anybody was looking
for some stuff,

00:04:11.063 --> 00:04:16.024
then all they'd have to do
would be to follow the spiders.

00:04:16.024 --> 00:04:18.592
Yep. That would lead them right.

00:04:18.592 --> 00:04:20.464
That's all I have to say.

00:04:22.683 --> 00:04:25.991
Oh, and someone'll need
to feed Fang while I'm away.

00:04:25.991 --> 00:04:29.734
[FANG GROWLS]

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:31.692
Good boy.

00:04:37.307 --> 00:04:39.483
Hagrid's right.

00:04:39.483 --> 00:04:40.832
With Dumbledore gone,

00:04:40.832 --> 00:04:42.747
there'll be
an attack a day.

00:04:42.747 --> 00:04:44.792
Look.

00:04:44.792 --> 00:04:47.142
[♪♪♪]

00:04:50.015 --> 00:04:51.756
Come on.

00:04:55.673 --> 00:04:57.762
Come on, Fang.

